B.ad8=new A.f8("Information You Provide","When you create an account we collect your first and last name, work email address, phone number (optional), your organization/company name, and a password. Your password is never stored by us in plain text \u2014 authentication is handled by our infrastructure provider, Supabase, which stores it in hashed form.")
B.acW=new A.f8("Business Data You Enter","As you use StockLyte, your organization's data \u2014 products, categories, stock quantities, locations, stock movements, and the accounts of team members you invite \u2014 is stored so the app can function. This data belongs to your organization and is kept in a database schema isolated from every other organization on StockLyte.")
B.acZ=new A.f8("Information Collected Automatically","When you sign up for a trial, we capture the IP address the request came from and an approximate location derived from it (city/region/country) for security and fraud-prevention purposes, and to notify our team of new signups internally. We also keep an internal audit log recording which user made which change within your organization's data, and when \u2014 this is visible to your organization's Admins for accountability, not to us or anyone outside your organization.")
B.ad7=new A.f8("How We Use Information","We use the information above to: create and secure your account; operate the core features of StockLyte; send trial, billing, and low-stock or system notifications; respond to support requests sent to info@impacgo.com; and maintain the security and reliability of the service.")
B.ad5=new A.f8("Third Parties We Use","We rely on a small number of infrastructure providers to run StockLyte: Supabase, for authentication and hosting our database; and an email delivery provider, for transactional emails such as trial reminders and account notifications. These providers process data on our behalf under their own security commitments \u2014 we do not sell your data to advertisers or data brokers, and we do not share it with any other third party for their own marketing purposes.")
B.add=new A.f8("Data Isolation Between Organizations","Every organization's business data lives in its own database schema. Application-level access controls and per-request checks ensure a user can only ever reach the data belonging to the organization they were added to.")
B.ad1=new A.f8("Data Retention","We keep your data for as long as your account is active. If your trial lapses or your subscription is suspended, your data is retained (not deleted) so that everything is exactly as you left it once access is restored. If an account remains inactive or unpaid for an extended period, we will make reasonable efforts to notify the organization's Admin before deleting the data permanently.")
B.ad3=new A.f8("Your Rights","You may ask us to access, correct, export, or delete the personal information we hold about you by emailing info@impacgo.com. We will respond within a reasonable time and in line with applicable data protection law. Note that deleting certain data may affect your organization's ability to use StockLyte.")
B.ad4=new A.f8("Data Security","We use industry-standard measures \u2014 including encrypted connections between the app and our servers, and role-based access controls \u2014 to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.")
B.ad2=new A.f8("Children's Privacy","StockLyte is a business tool intended for use by working professionals and is not directed at, or knowingly used to collect information from, children under 18.")
B.ad_=new A.f8("Changes to This Policy",'We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above.')
B.acR=new A.f8("Contact Us","For any questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, contact us at info@impacgo.com.")
